          "title": "飞碟屋",
          "content": "<p>1965年，一位朋友委托芬兰建筑师 Matti Suuronen 设计滑雪小屋，要求构造简单、价格便宜、而且加热效率高。小屋设计出来以后，有着椭圆形塑料舷窗和折叠式，很像外星飞碟。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111202.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111203.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这种小屋进行了量产，作为便携式度假屋，在全世界销售。它高4米，宽8米，有一个大房间和一个小浴室，当时的售价是1.2万美元到1.4万美元（相当于现在的8.4万美元到10.5万美元）。</p>\n<p>这种小屋一共生产了96座，目前还存在67座。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111204.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111205.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "飞碟屋",
              "url": "https://theoutline.com/post/8005/futuro-house-the-home-of-the-future-that-never-was?zd=1&zi=tawqatgr"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111202.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111203.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111204.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111205.jpg"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "2D 咖啡馆",
          "content": "<p>日本东京有一家 2D 咖啡馆，以白色作为唯一色调，设计的时候考虑了视觉效果，使得整个咖啡馆看上去就像平面图片一样。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111206.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111207.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>有些东西确实是画出来的，比如窗帘和盆栽，但是桌椅都是实物。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111208.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201911/bg2019111210.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
