        {
          "title": "如",
          "content": "<p>果一项技术足够流行，就会有人将其添加到烤面包机中。</p>\n<p>-- 一位作者评论 <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/258723592/toasteroid-first-app-controlled-smart-image-toaste\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Toasteroid 面包机</a>。这种面包机可以将天气预报打印在烤面包片上。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202001/bg2020010102.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202001/bg2020010101.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
